notes.content:
Patch Note Ver 1.1.1
================================
Update:	
	Added 7 steam achievements;
	In Chapter 7, Phoenix is immune to poisoning now;
	When the enemy's attack range is enabled, it can be updated when the player is moving;

Patch Note Ver 1.1.0
================================
Bug fixed:
	Fixed the problem that the width of the battle prediction interface was too large;
	Fixed the issue where the skill of "golden axe" is not displayed when triggered;
	Fixed the issue that Gael could not attack in Chapter 7;
	Fixed the issue of avoidance animation in battle animation;

Patch Note Ver 1.0.9
================================
Update:
	Increase weapon restraint. When it is superior, it displays a green arrow to increase damage and hit; when it is inferior, it displays a red arrow to reduce damage and hit;
	In chapter 5,the enemy increases the drop of cavalry special effects guns;
	Increase the number of battles and the number of victories recorded for the character details of the army;

Patch Note Ver 1.0.8
================================
Bug fixed:
	Fixed the issue that the arena command is not displayed in Chapter 4;
	Fixed an issue where the number of enemy troops displayed incorrectly when confirming the target in Chapter 4;

Update:
	After Chapter 3 is over, an exploration map will be added to the base, and the map reward is Bobo’s class transfer item;
	When the character is upgraded, the level display is added in the window;
	Add message log option to the map command list;
	Map saving command is no longer limited to the beginning of each round;
	The activation rate of prayer skills is adjusted to (lucky×3)%, and the upper limit is 75%;
	Change the classification icon of the item;

Patch Note Ver 1.0.7
================================
Bug fixed:
	Fixed an issue where the character's HP was 1 in the plot of Chapter 1;	
	Fixed the terrain error of Chapter 3 residential houses;
	Fixed the animation problem of male archers shooting at close range in the arena;
	Fixed the issue of Gehrmann's incorrect call in Chapter 4;
	Fixed the issue of Phoenix’s HP display error when the map role window is set to medium 
          in Chapter 7;

Update:
	After defeating a certain number of enemies with the same weapon, the name of the weapon will be marked, and continued use can gradually increase the weapon's crit rate;

	Changed the character picture of Kasa and Kaname Ryou;

	Acht, Bobo, Montauk, Rego, Cassandra's basic luck increased by 2 points, and the basic HP increased by 1 point;

Patch Note Ver 1.0.6
================================
Bug fixed:
	The skill of fury can be triggered correctly in battle;
	Character skills can be displayed and sorted correctly;

Update:
	Display the maximum limit value of the items that can be used;
	Changed the battle picture of Kasa and Kaname Ryou;
	In Chapter 7, Rego can get the flower skirt at the river god;

Patch Note Ver 1.0.5
================================
Update:
	Modify the role map of the female thief;
	Increase the assault skills of your female thief, which can be learned at level 7;
	Modify the battle animations of male knights, female knights, and male paladins;
	The trigger limit of the skill Meteor Sword has been reduced from 90% to 80%;

Patch Note Ver 1.0.4
================================
Bug fixed:
	Modify the battle animation of the spearman, soldier, female knight, and heavy armor warrior when using the throwing spear;
	Modify the battle animation of bandits and warriors when throwing axes;

Update:
	Increase the repair shop in the base, and cancel the repair powder in the weapon shop and item shop;
	Change the battle animation of our female thief;

Patch Note Ver 1.0.3
================================
Bug fixed:
	Enemy cavalry can move correctly after an attack;

Update:
	Optimize the exit button in the map command;
	When a unit is selected on the map, displayed level, experience, etc. Can be modified in the settings;
	When level up, the attributes increase one by one, and when there is no attribute increase, HP+1;
	"Defense" attribute was renamed;

Patch Note Ver 1.0.2
================================
Bug fixed:
	Fixed an option error in Chapter 3;
	Fixed an issue with pressing Esc to exit the game;
	Fixed an issue with pressing F11 to reset the game	

Update:
	Add a fighting field in Chapter 4;
{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/38353125/f4fd0795b4d2d51afe034f661af627f2aef589de.jpg
{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/38353125/5a200c1774606ce7455eae7c2ee15158e0fa9498.jpg
	Updated the AI of the 2 enemy units in Chapter 3;
	Updated the blood bar in battle to multiple rectangles, and displayed as a question mark when HP greater than 60;

Patch Note Ver 1.0.1
================================
Bug fixed:
	Fixed the problem that Yadi’s attributes were too low in Chapter 6;
	Fixed the texture error of the gate in Chapter 5;
	Fixed the issue of enemy shouting in Chapter 4;

Update:
	Update the model of the protagonist group;
	Updated the avatar of the female magician;
	Added MISS prompt during battle;

Existing Problems:	
	After loading, the MISS prompts of enemy soldiers, archers, and thieves are reversed. 
	There is no such problem after the new game or the next chapter.
